# Frontend — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`. Forms/UI/validation **defaults stay on**.

- One UI baseline route owns the visual language; shells inherit Tailwind tokens
- Page transitions, infinite scroll, slideshow, parallax: `ui-styling-advanced.mdc`
- Motion budget; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Performance: lazy load routes/chunks; optimize LCP
- Charts/graphs use theme colors from shared wrapper
- Do not abandon locked ui-styling/forms/icons-states for speed
